  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper evaluates a hybrid pipeline where 20‑day SMA and Bollinger Band windows are encoded into 20×20 Quantum Gramian Angular Field (QGAF) images using a simulated Qiskit circuit and classified with a multi‑input CNN. On a test set of 1,250 samples the model achieves 54.2% accuracy, with strong bias toward predicting upward movements (recall_up = 0.928 vs recall_down = 0.085), demonstrating severe overfitting and no practical predictive advantage.",
